  "explain": [
    {
      "t": "intro",
      "wide": true,
      "es": "Cuando vamos de <b>compras</b> (shopping) necesitamos tres cosas: <b>preguntar el precio</b> (<i>How much is it?</i>), <b>pedir con educación</b> (<i>I'd like…, please</i>) y <mark>entender y decir los precios</mark> (<i>£3.50 = three pounds fifty</i>). ¡Vamos de tiendas en inglés!",
      "en": "When we go shopping we need to ask the price, ask politely and understand and say prices.",
      "formula": [
        "*How much* + is it?",
        "*I'd like* + cosa + *please*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "table",
      "title": "El dinero",
      "title_en": "Money",
      "icon": "💷",
      "color": "green",
      "head": [
        "",
        "🇬🇧 Libra · Pound (£)",
        "Euro (€)"
      ],
