    {
      "t": "rule",
      "title": "3 · HOW MUCH IS / ARE…?",
      "title_en": "Asking the price",
      "icon": "❓",
      "color": "green",
      "es": "Para preguntar el precio usamos <b>How much…?</b> Si es <b>una</b> cosa → <b>How much is</b> this / that…? Si son <b>varias</b> → <b>How much are</b> these / those…? Respondemos con <b>It's…</b> o <b>They're…</b>",
      "en": "One thing: <b>How much is</b> this? — It's… More than one: <b>How much are</b> these? — They're…",
      "formula": [
        "*How much is* + this / that + cosa?",
        "*How much are* + these / those + cosas?"
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "<b>How much is</b> this cap? — <b>It's</b> £8.",
          "es": "¿Cuánto cuesta esta gorra? — Cuesta 8 libras.",
          "icon": "🧢"
        },
        {
