        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "rule",
      "title": "4 · El verbo COST",
      "title_en": "The verb cost",
      "icon": "💰",
      "color": "teal",
      "es": "También podemos usar el verbo <b>cost</b> (costar). Es un verbo normal de presente simple: <b>it costs</b> (con -s) / <b>they cost</b>. Para preguntar necesitamos <b>does / do</b>: <b>How much does it cost?</b> ¡Nunca <s>How much costs it?</s>!",
      "en": "<b>It costs</b> / <b>they cost</b>. Questions: <b>How much does it cost?</b> / <b>How much do they cost?</b>",
      "formula": [
        "*How much does* + it / this + *cost?*",
        "*How much do* + they / these + *cost?*"
      ],
      "examples": [
